window.products.push({"id":136060,"name":"4434ER0002D 4434ER0002A Rear Drum Spider - replace the AP5592038 lg spider washer spinner support on the wm2455hg,wm2050cw,wm2487hwm,WM3050cw wm3470hv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+r9-njLGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟯 𝗗𝗜𝗙𝗙𝗘𝗥𝗘𝗡𝗧 𝗦𝗘𝗖𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡𝗦】--The package includes 1 x 4434ER0002D 4434ER0002A Washer Spinner Support for supporting and rotating the spinning basket, which is divided into 3 different sections which contain the rotor, stator and bearings that drive all areas of the wash cycle. 4434ER0002A washer rotary support center shaft height is about 5.4in, side length is 19.3in, the distance from one end to the center is about 9.6in. The spider arm itself doesn't take long to remove/install, but it does take some time to get everything disassembled to get to the part. 【𝗛𝗜𝗚𝗛 𝗤𝗨𝗔𝗟𝗜𝗧𝗬 𝗜𝗥𝗢𝗡】-- 4434er0002d rear drum spider support is a durable structure made of heavy duty IRON, which is durable, strong and elastic to ensure lasting, and has the advantages of preventing corrosion, damage and fracture. If your washing machine has a broken bath, smoke when you open the door, a burnt rubber smell, or if the washing machine shakes excessively and makes a lot of noise during rotation, that's when you'll need a 4434er0002a spider. 【𝟯𝟲𝟱 𝗗𝗔𝗬𝗦 𝗪𝗔𝗥𝗥𝗔𝗡𝗧𝗬】--The 4434ER0002D 4434ER0002A Washing Machine Rear Drum Support and Shaft Assembly 365 days RETURN and EXCHANGE. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. Risk-free shopping, if you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. ▶4434ER0002D lg spider can solve these problems: ①washing machine leakage, ②unable to lock, ③unable to start, ④Inner drum swings, ⑤the seat where the seal goes is damaged. 【𝗪𝗜𝗗𝗘 𝗖𝗢𝗠𝗣𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗕𝗜𝗟𝗜𝗧𝗬】-- 4434ER0003D Washer spinner support suitable for Ken-more Elite 796 and L-G washing machines. Replaces numbers: 79641182310, 79641282310, 79641472210, 79641372211, 79641373210, 79641373211, WM3470HVA, WM3470HWA, WM3050CW, WM3250HWA, WM3470HWA/00, WM2077CW, WM2501HVA, WM2277HW/00, WM2077CW/00, WM2233HW/00, WM3070HRA/00, WM2032HS, WM3470HVA/00, WM2487HWMA, WM2233HS, WM2233HU, WM2601HW, WM2601HL, WM2801HRA, WM2801HWA, WM3001HPA, WM3001HRA, WM3001HWA, WM3070HWA, WM3250HRA, WM3250HVA, WM3987HW, WM3988HWA, etc. 【𝗘𝗔𝗦𝗬 𝗜𝗡𝗦𝗧𝗔𝗟𝗟𝗔𝗧𝗜𝗢𝗡】--Before installing the lg washer spinner support 4434er0002a, turn off the washing machine power, open the laundry cabinet, remove the bathtub, and separate the pipes. You can watch the installation video on Youtube and it won't take long. After all removal, thoroughly clean and flush the pump and pump lines, and check the pump blades to make sure all water lines are securely connected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+r9-njLGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0838W1PPW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136060","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0838W1PPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0838W1PPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
