window.products.push({"id":136121,"name":"2 Piece {Starter Pack} Reusable K Cup and K Carafe Coffee Filter for Keurig 2.0 Compatible with Keurig 2.0: K200, K300, K400, K500 Series & Keurig 1.0","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PmvKhS5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHAT’S IN THE BOX · 1x reusable 4-6 cup K Carafe · 1x reusable K cup · Includes stainless steel mesh designed for longevity and flavor preservation BUDGET LIKE A BARISTA Consider that a daily coffee consumer spends $300+ on Keurig capsules. If you were to replace wasteful capsules with a CAFFÈ VERDE reusable k cup filter and McCafe premium dark roast (found at your local convenient store), you can expect a conservative estimate of 60%+ savings. OUR VISION Unlock Keurig 2.0 potential with the innovative CAFFÈ VERDE eco-filter (Reusable K Cup / Carafe K Cups) that preserves the authenticity of your own personal coffee roast, while respecting both the environment and your hard earned dollars. BARISTA’S MANUAL 1- Open lid and fill with favourite ground coffee 2- Close lid and press firmly around entire lid contour  3- Place reusable k cup in brewer with middle arrow pointing up 4- Brew & savour your own personalized coffee 5- Clean – rinse & insert reusable k cup in top rack of dishwasher DISCLAIMER · Do not fill reusable k cup to the top, no more than 7/8 · Caution: Hot after use. Please allow filter to cool before handling · Keurig Carafe K-carafe DOES NOT FIT the 1.0 Brewer series BARISTA’S RECOMMENDATIONS · Finer ground = stronger brew · Coarser ground = lighter brew YOUR CHOICE · Infusions such as espresso, coffee, loose leaf tea, hot chocolate, hot cocoa, etc. · Option to blend various types of coffee together to add body and richness BARISTA’S STAMP OF APPROVAL · Developed from AAA quality 18/8 stainless steel, the permanent micro etched mesh filter reusable k cup ensures durability and flavor preservation · Lid w/ silicone O-Ring for a snug fit and BPA-free plastic specifically designed to resist high temperatures","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PmvKhS5uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Friendly Barista","source_asin":"B01A5WTAPI","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A5WTAPI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A5WTAPI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
