window.products.push({"id":136292,"name":"Funmit W10780048 Washer Suspension Rod Kit (4pcs) with W10400895 Washer Suspension Springs (4pcs) Replacement for Whirlpool Kenmore Amana Maytag Washi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.18,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pp7qRd6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COST-EFFECTIVE GOODS: Our W10780048 suspension rod kit contains all the required replacement parts to complete the standard installation of your washer. Package includes 4 x 23.6-inch suspension rod, 4 x suspension ball, 4 x bushing and 4 x W10400895 suspension spring. The suspension rods help to dampen the movement of the washer tub. If one or more of the suspension rods are broken, the washer will vibrate or shake WIDE APPLICATION: W10780048 washer suspension rod kit is compatible with Whirlpool, Amana, Jenn Air, Ken-more, May-tag, Roper and Admiral washing machines. W10780048 is equivalent to part number W10257087, W10257088, W10349191, W10349193, W10748952, W10821948, 4185114, AP5971398, EAP11703290 and PS11703290. W10400895 suspension spring is equivalent to part number LP22618, PS3497596, W10400895VP, AH3497596, EA3497596 and 1938554 MAINTAIN BALANCE: This suspension rods support the washing tub and balance the washing machine under unbalanced conditions to reduce vibration. It acts as a shock absorber that allows the washer tub to move while helping minimize vibration in the spin mode. If the washer loses balance or code error, use the damper to keep balance back to normal use. The unbalanced load error \"uL\" in cabrio style machines is often caused by faulty suspension PREMIUM QUALITY: Our W10780048 washer suspension rod kit is made of high quality material well-tested by the manufacturer, not OEM but quality equal to OEM requirements, and provides sufficient support, higher efficiency, durability and the best quality for a longer service life. The right choice for you EASY TO INSTALL: Tools needed for this installation are: Philips screwdriver, putty knife, duct tape, a strap and gloves. It is a cheap way to fix your washing machine by using the supplied spring. Before servicing, disconnect all power sources and wear work gloves to protect your hands. If you're not sure how to install it, please watch the related video on youtube to help you 1 YEAR WARRANTY: Funmit adhere to provide all customers with a simple, streamlined shopping experience of large appliance replacement parts, and prove that we have the highest quality parts and service out there. We stand by our products, and our customers are our focus as a business. If you have any quality problem during warranty period (💓365 DAYS FREE GUARANTEE), please contact Funmit customer service team in time, and we will try our best to solve your problems","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pp7qRd6ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Funmit","source_asin":"B08LPDRV6T","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136292","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LPDRV6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LPDRV6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
