window.products.push({"id":136508,"name":"Gastrorag Large-Capacity Stainless Steel Automatic Portable Electric Countertop Ice Maker Machine, 26lbs/24H, 9 Cubes Ready in 10 minutes, 3 Types of ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDvdab2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FAST – This portable ice maker is perfect for everyday use at home or even for parties and gatherings. Generous 0.58-gal. water reservoir produces 9 bullet-shaped ice cubes in 10 minutes and a total of 26 lb. of ice per day. Insulated basket holds 2,20 lb. of finished ice (~100 ice cubes). Ice stays cold for several hours. Recycles excess water for new cycle so you’re refilling less. EASY – Just fill with water, choose your ice size (small, medium, or large), set your desired start time, wait for the indicator lights to signal that the basket is full, then serve! LED lights also notify you when the water level is low for quick refilling, or keep track of your ice yourself through the transparent top. Includes a removable bucket and scoop for serving. No water connection is required, so no complicated hook-ups. COMPACT & LIGHTWEIGHT – At 12.9'' x 9.8'' x 14.2'' and 24.25 lb., this mini ice maker won’t take up much counter space and is easy to transport. Use it in your home bar or kitchen, and even take it camping in your RV or boat. QUIET – Don’t let its speed fool you — this ice machine is super quiet and environmentally friendly. BEAUTIFUL – Sleek and space-saving, the stainless-steel countertop ice maker with blue LED-display matches any decor perfectly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LDvdab2bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GASTRORAG","source_asin":"B08C2ZTVZX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C2ZTVZX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C2ZTVZX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":136509,"name":"COTLIN 15 Inch Built-in Ice Maker Machine with 22LBS/24H, Undercounter Crescent Ice Machine with Freezer for Residential Commercial Use, No Drain Requ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":729.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qw3pTl-OL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Crescent Ice Maker】The quality COTLIN Ice Machine makes up to 22lbs of crescent ice a day! With the capacity of 22lbs ice storage bin, it holds plenty of ice for large families, parties, cookouts, or any of your entertaining needs. Bring the transparent and taste-free ice served in bars and restaurants right into the comforts of your own home, outdoor kitchen, and even boat or yacht. 【Compact Undercounter Size】Crescent ice maker is 14.8” x 21.3” x 27.8” in size which makes it easier to fit under standard kitchen bar counter, ensure convenient access to ice. Cutout dimension is 15.38’’*23.35’’*28.25’’, make sure leaving enough space to install and keep it ventilation. Compact and freestanding design make it easy to transport and you can keep it anywhere you want like custom man cave or den. 【Unique Ice Shape & Freezer Frozen】Our residential ice machine produce crystal-clear, odorless crescent shaped ice that keep your beverage truer to the ﬂavors you love. Crescent ice feature slow-melting, uniquely-shaped that’s perfect for premium liquor and mixed drinks. Plus, equipped with powerful freezer inside, always keeping ice frozen from 21.2-32℉avoid melting. 【Durable Material & Reversible Door】Crafted with a sturdy heavy duty stainless steel and black matte, this compact ice maker offer the consumer a long-term reliability and also a perfect combination of other home appliance. The door and the hinge is reversible, you can choose to install left or right side according to your need. It’s easy to clean and maintain, make sure manual defrost regularly after use. 【Easy to Use & 100% Satisfaction】As a free-standing commercial ice machine you simply connect the water supply connector and the power cord to create a hands-free system that produces ice continuously to ensure you’re always party ready. Include ice scoop, water line, and removable ice bin. COTLIN is committed to providing customers with after sales service and we guarantee 30 days new replacement on quality problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qw3pTl-OL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COTLIN","source_asin":"B0C7CKGJST","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7CKGJST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7CKGJST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
