window.products.push({"id":136558,"name":"LED Temperature Humidity Sensor Digit Display RS4 85 Modbus RTU Humidity Temperature Sensor External Sensor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CkDDjq8pL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: Temperature and humidity combined sensor AM2320 digital temperature and humidity sensor is a digital signal output has been calibrated. Using special temperature and humidity acquisition technology, ensure that the product has a very high reliability and excellent long-term stability. Sensor consists of a capacitive moisture element and an integrated high-precision temperature measurement devices, and connected with a high-performance microprocessor. The product has excellent quality, super fast response, strong anti-interference ability. Specifications: Working Voltage: DC 5-40V(6.5-28V recommended) Working Current: Digital tube turn off is 5MA(12V), Digital tube turn on is 18MA(12V) Serial Baud Rate: 9600(default), N, 8, 1 How to use: 1. Display \"Eror\" after power-on. If \"Eror\" is displayed for a long time, it indicates that the sensor is not connected or is damaged. 2. After 5 seconds, display the temperature or humidity. 3. Trigger \"KEY\" button to switch the display temperature and humidity.(This parameter is powered down memory). 4. Press and hold the \"KEY\" button for 3 seconds to turn off or turn on the display.(This parameter is also powered down memory). Package Includes: 1 × Module 1 × External Sensor Note: 1. If the digital tube is turn off after power-on, press and hold the \"KEY\" button until the digital tube is turn on. 2. With the built-in sensor version (R444A01_A), turn on the display for a long time will let the temperature rise 1-2 degrees Celsius. It is recommended to turn off the digital tube, or use a version with an external sensor (R444A01_B). Please note that the new type and old type of this product will be sent randomly, and make sure you will not mind beforeordering","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CkDDjq8pL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Walfront","source_asin":"B078NRYBVZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078NRYBVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B078NRYBVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
