window.products.push({"id":136843,"name":"AppliaFit Dryer Drum Belt Compatible With, General Electric Hotpoint Dryer Drum Belt WE12X10014 (WE12X82). (1-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYDEevM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacing your dryer drum belt is a quick and easy fix for your dryer, using your AppliaFit WE12X10014 (WE12X82) dryer drum belt. This dryer drum belt attaches to a pulley system which is what turns the drum during your drying cycle. The dryer belt goes in between the dryer motor and the dryer drum. If your dryer belt breaks, the dryer will no longer work like it should. Replacing the dryer belt can fix the following problems: - Dryer making loud noises - Dryer not starting - Dryer won’t tumble - Dryer can't produce enough heat - Dryer won't heat up at all It's compatible with Frigidaire, GE, Hotpoint, Electrolux etc. Wondering if this will fit your model? Let us know and we'll be happy to help you find the belt that fits your dryer. Often times the same part may have different numbers, this part is compatible with the following: WE12X10014, WE12X82AP4379804, 103C7487, 1472898, AH2350043, B008YDSN5O, EA2350043, PS2350043, WE12X0042, WE12X0082, WE12X42, WE12X42P, WE12X42R, WE12X82, WE12X82E, WE12X82P, WE12X82R. Packaging may vary. The brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tYDEevM5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AppliaFit","source_asin":"B087NGRVJC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087NGRVJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087NGRVJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
