window.products.push({"id":136989,"name":"2-in-1 Ice Maker and Shaver Machine - LINKLIFE Countertop Ice Maker with Ice Crusher, Self Cleaning, LCD Indicator, Bullet Ice Pellet Ice Nugget Ice S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":218.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ekL-qzGHL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2-in-1 Ice Maker】This LINKLIFE Ice Maker has two functions, producing ice cubes and crushed ice that can meet your different needs in life. It includes an ice scoop, a cup and a removable ice basket. 【Quickly and Quiet Making Ice Cubes】producing 12 crystal clear round ice every 10-12 minutes, and can produce about 33 lbs of ice per day. Just like the ice you love from your favorite restaurant. And the basket inside can hold 2.2 lbs. You can also put the ice cubes in the crushing box right away, and wait seconds, than you can enjoy the drink or snow cone. 【Smart Ice Maker】An intuitive LCD screen indicator lets you know the current status of your ice maker – whether it’s actively making ice, or in standby mode (cause it’s full of ice or if it’s waiting for more water). It will automatically stop making ice when there is low water/full ice, so you don’t have to worry it will damage or overflow when you use it. The clear viewing window lets you see how much ice is available. 【Cycle ice】When you use this machine, you don't have to worry about the extra ice being wasted. When ice cubes melt into water, the machine will make the melted water into new ice cubes. You can choose manually or automatically to add water (connect to a water pipe, the ice machine is also equipped with a water filter, you can install it with the water pipe). A drainage port is located at the bottom of the ice maker for easy maintenance and cleaning. 【Efficient & Low Noise Compressor】The nugget ice maker is equipped with a highly efficient compressor, a high-quality copper aluminum fin capacitor and Quiet DC fan, which is not only excellent in refrigeration, but also low noise during making ice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ekL-qzGHL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINKLIFE","source_asin":"B099HZFZF5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-136989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099HZFZF5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B099HZFZF5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
